        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "Key signs you need a new roof in Utah include an age over 20 years, curling or missing shingles, heavy granule loss in gutters from intense mountain sun, and sagging roof decks or interior water leaks aggravated by heavy winter snow and ice dams.",
        "snippet_highlighted_words": [
          "an age over 20 years, curling or missing shingles, heavy granule loss in gutters from intense mountain sun, and sagging roof decks or interior water leaks aggravated by heavy winter snow and ice dams"
